==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's standard illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Fusion Strike|Blissey|203}} from the {{TCG|Fusion Strike}} expansion.
*'''Energy Blow''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Platinum|Shaymin|38}} from the {{TCG|Platinum}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Scarlet}}.

